        <!--
            SKAdNetwork (SKAN 4) declarations.

            Apple delivers attribution postbacks only to ad networks whose
            SKAdNetworkIdentifier is declared here. Without this array the
            install is invisible to every UA channel → everything bucketed
            as Organic.

            List sourced from the community-maintained canonical registry at
            https://skanids.com (62 entries, 2026-05-29). Covers all major
            networks plus the two we actively run campaigns through:
              · Apple Search Ads  c6k4g5qg8m.skadnetwork
              · Reddit Ads        2u9pt9hc89.skadnetwork
            Extra entries do no harm — they future-proof us against adding
            Meta / TikTok / AppLovin / etc later without another resubmit.

            ATT was removed in 1.7.3 (NSUserTrackingUsageDescription is
            intentionally absent), so SKAN is the ONLY attribution channel
            we have. Tenjin's MMP path runs on top of these postbacks.
